  "details": "- Upgrade to openjdk-11.0.31+11 (GA). The following CVEs were fixed:\n- CVE-2026-22016: enhance Path Factories redux\n- CVE-2026-34282: enhance TLS connection handling\n- CVE-2025-66293: update libpng (out-of-bounds read in png_image_read_composite)\n- CVE-2026-22695: update libpng (heap over-read in png_image_finish_read)\n- CVE-2026-22801: update libpng (integer truncation in simplified write API)\n- CVE-2026-25646: update libpng (heap buffer overflow in png_set_quantize)\n- CVE-2026-33416: update libpng (use-after-free in png_set_tRNS)\n- CVE-2026-33636: update libpng (out-of-bounds read/write in Neon palette expansion)",
